{"Date": "10/14/2025", "Permit Number": "B2025-04560", "Project Name": "Building Permit", "Status": "Finaled", "Address": "1401 UNIVERSITY Ave, BERKELEY CA 94702", "Action": "", "Description": "Modified Bitumen CertainTeed 20-Year Warranty Full Roof Replacement Remove existing roofing down to the deck, including membranes and flashings. Inspect for damage and replace rotten wood if needed ($4/sqft after 15% threshold). Clean the deck thoroughly to ensure it\u2019s dry, smooth, and debris-free. Correct slope for proper drainage if needed, using tapered insulation or sloped fill ($5/sqft). Install CertainTeed Glasbase Base Sheet per manufacturer specs, sealing all seams. Torch-apply CertainTeed Flintlastic STA Interply with aligned, sealed laps. Install Flintlastic GTA Granule Cap Sheet as the final UV- and weather-resistant layer. Replace or install new flashing and edge metal at all required areas. Seal all penetrations and terminations with SmartFlash and approved caulking. Reinforce vulnerable areas with proper detailing. Conduct final inspection and leave the site clean and safe.", "_cells": ["", "10/14/2025", "B2025-04560", "Building Permit", "Finaled", "1401 UNIVERSITY Ave, BERKELEY CA 94702", "", "Modified Bitumen CertainTeed 20-Year Warranty Full Roof Replacement Remove existing roofing down to the deck, including membranes and flashings. Inspect for damage and replace rotten wood if needed ($4/sqft after 15% threshold). Clean the deck thoroughly to ensure it\u2019s dry, smooth, and debris-free. Correct slope for proper drainage if needed, using tapered insulation or sloped fill ($5/sqft). Install CertainTeed Glasbase Base Sheet per manufacturer specs, sealing all seams. Torch-apply CertainTeed Flintlastic STA Interply with aligned, sealed laps. Install Flintlastic GTA Granule Cap Sheet as the final UV- and weather-resistant layer. Replace or install new flashing and edge metal at all required areas. Seal all penetrations and terminations with SmartFlash and approved caulking. Reinforce vulnerable areas with proper detailing. Conduct final inspection and leave the site clean and safe.", "1401 UNIVERSITY Ave, BERKELEY CA 94702"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Building&TabName=Building&capID1=DUB25&capID2=00000&capID3=00ORD&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
